# Normalize text files to LF regardless of platform/checkout settings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixture and asset binaries must be committed byte-for-byte, never
# LF/CRLF-normalized (some, like our hand-built encrypted.pdf, contain no
# NUL bytes and would otherwise be misdetected as text by git's heuristic —
# and a PDF's xref byte offsets break if a single \n becomes \r\n).
*.pdf binary
*.csv binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
